# Loon - HK / US finance routing for Mainland China
# Policy: affected HK/US brokerage apps -> PROXY; banks, payment, regulators,
# public market data, and Chief/Chi Fu Securities -> DIRECT.
# Replace PROXY with your own proxy policy/group name if needed.
# Do not wrap this file with a single policy; it already mixes PROXY and DIRECT.


# ============================================================
# DIRECT - Chief Securities / Chi Fu hard bypass
# Keep this block before every PROXY rule. Chief can show a VPN
# warning if its trading, quote, H5, support, or IP-check traffic
# exits through a proxy.
# ============================================================

# Chief Securities / Chi Fu / Chief Trade / Chief Group
